### Cadastrar usuário
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "João Silva",
  "cpf": "12345678900",
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "senha": "123456",
  "telefone": "87999999999",
  "dataNascimento": "1990-05-15"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "joao@email.com",
  "senha": "123456"
}

